This extension adds Jurassic World Evolution 3 modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]Epic[/*]
[*]Xbox (Game Pass)[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs ACSE itself to the "Win64\ovldata" folder, recognised by an "ACSE" file.[/*]
[*]Installs Root Game Folder mod with a "Win64" folder to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[*]Installs ACSE mod with a "Main.ovl" file to the "Win64\ovldata" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs ACSE Localization mod with a file or folder named "localised" to the "Win64\ovldata\ACSE" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs Movies (.webm) mod with a ".webm" file to the "Movies" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs ovldata Subfolder mod with an "ovldata" file to the "Win64" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs Saves mod with a ".blpr2" file to the "USER_HOME\Saved Games\Frontier Developments\Jurassic World Evolution 3\USERID_FOLDER\Saves" folder.[/*]
[*]Any other mod not described above is installed to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

